Package: perioepe
Title: Estimate Expected Periodontitis Experience Under Informative Tooth Loss
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kym", "McCormick", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "your.email@example.com")
  )
Description: Early-stage tools for estimating Expected Periodontitis Experience
    from observed periodontal data when tooth loss is treated as informative
    missingness. The current version supports a first-iteration model using
    age, observed tooth-level CAL, missing teeth, and age-specific extraction
    attribution evidence.
